/**
 * Models derived from Kie's own schemas.
 *
 * Generated by `scripts/generate-models.mts` from the snapshot in
 * `scripts/kie/schemas.json`, which is fetched from every model page on
 * docs.kie.ai. Do not edit by hand: the next run overwrites it.
 *
 * This file exists because hand transcription does not scale and does not
 * stay right. Four models in the hand-written catalog carried a slug Kie has
 * never heard of, ten sent fields that do not exist, and five offered voice
 * IDs the API refuses. Every one of those was invisible until a generation
 * failed. Deriving the enums, defaults, bounds and required flags from the
 * same document the API validates against removes that whole class of fault.
 *
 * What a generator cannot judge is what a model is *for*. Names and taglines
 * come from `scripts/curation.json` where someone has written one, and are
 * otherwise built from the schema: dull, but true.
 *
 * To refresh:
 *   bun scripts/fetch-kie-schemas.mts
 *   bun --preload ./scripts/preload.ts scripts/generate-models.mts <slugs…>
 */

